  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "プロデューサー、\r\nアタシの食レポ……どうだった？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里らしさが出た、いいレポートだったと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おー、そっか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\n何か気になるのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お店の人にも、\r\nスタジオの人たちにもいい反応をもらえてたじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "んー……\r\nいっぱいいっぱいだったから、なんか実感がなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺にはちゃんと結果を出せたように見えたよ\r\nそれに何より……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "元気があった",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "いい食べっぷり\r\nだったぞ！",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "いいコメントができてた",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020140,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……それ、食レポに関係あるか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "元気があるに越したことはないぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そりゃそうだけどさ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、商品の魅力を伝えるのも、\r\n樹里の魅力を伝えるのも、どっちも大切なことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……伝わってた、か……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "伝わってた！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……そっか\r\nじゃあ、アンタの言葉を信じるよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020180,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "今回はいい結果だった、ってことで",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──あ、もちろん\r\n今日の映像は、後でちゃんと見返して反省するからな！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……！\r\n樹里のそういう真面目なところ、頼もしいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
