  {
    "id": 2011011020200,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え、そうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nそれこそ智代子にも劣らないくらいだったんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020210,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "な、なんか恥ずかしーな、それ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\nでも、樹里の魅力を出すことと同じように",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "商品を美味しそうに見せるのも、\r\n食レポにおいて大事なことだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まー、そうだよな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……つーかアンタは\r\nあのスイーツ、食べてないんだよな？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　ああ、そうだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020240,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──うし\r\nじゃー買って帰って、一緒に食べようぜ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020250,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "絶対美味しいからさ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
