  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『運動した後にも食べられるくらい\r\n爽やかなクリームです』──なんて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普通はなかなか出てこないコメントだと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020260,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あー……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020270,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あれは、自然に出ただけっつーか……\r\n結果、お店の人に笑われちゃったし",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもあの笑いは\r\nいい意味の方だったと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どう見たって自然に出た\r\n嘘のない言葉だったからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020280,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そっか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020290,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシ、上手くやらなきゃとしか考えてなかったけど\r\n自然なコメントだって、いいのか",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\n本番前に『自然体で』って伝えたつもりだったんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020300,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "えっ、気付かなかった……！\r\n悪い……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101102/2011011020300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、いいんだ\r\n結局、言葉よりも体験して学ぶことが一番だし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回、樹里が自分で何かを掴んでくれたなら\r\n俺はそれが一番嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011020310,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……おー……！\r\nなら今回は、成功……かな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
